OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785230313
OL,3,CPolice looking into Polanski post
OL,4,Cafter complaints by Reform UK
OL,6,FThe Met Police has said it is making
OL,7,Fenquiries after a post reshared by
OL,8,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski was
OL,9,Freported to them by Reform UK.
OL,11,FIn the image, a man can be seen
OL,12,Fwearing a black t-shirt with a
OL,13,Fguillotine on the front, along with
OL,14,Fthe words: "We're only making plans
OL,15,Ffor Nigel", apparently alluding to
OL,16,FReform's leader Nigel Farage.
OL,18,FReform have said the picture amounts
OL,19,Fto incitement to murder.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
