OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785230313
OL,3,CPolice looking into Polanski post
OL,4,Cafter complaints by Reform UK
OL,6,FThe photo was shared as part of a
OL,7,Fbigger carousel of photos from a Green
OL,8,FParty event in Bristol, with Polanski
OL,9,Finvited to be a collaborator on the
OL,10,Fpost. He did not share the picture
OL,11,Fhimself.
OL,13,FFarage shared a screenshot of the
OL,14,Fimage on X, writing: "This is what
OL,15,FZack Polanski has just posted on his
OL,16,FInstagram. If I was to post anything
OL,17,Fas inciteful then I would expect to be
OL,18,Farrested, and so should Polanski."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
