OL,3,CPolice looking into Polanski post
OL,4,Cafter complaints by Reform UK
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the Met Police said
OL,12,Fofficers were looking into the image.
OL,14,F"Earlier today - Monday, 27 July - we
OL,15,Freceived a third-party report relating
OL,16,Fto an image shared on social media,"
OL,17,Fthe statement said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
