OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785230313
OL,3,CPolice looking into Polanski post
OL,4,Cafter complaints by Reform UK
OL,6,F"We take reports of this nature
OL,7,Fextremely seriously, and officers are
OL,8,Fconducting enquiries into the matter."
OL,9,F.
OL,11,FReform's spokesperson for home affairs
OL,12,FZia Yusuf claimed the image was
OL,13,F"incitement to murder", saying: "To do
OL,14,Fthis just two weeks after our friend
OL,15,FAnn (Widdecombe) was murdered is
OL,16,Fstaggering."
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the Green Party
OL,19,Fsaid Zack had not seen the image in
OL,20,Fthe carousel when he collaborated with
OL,21,Fit.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
