OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785230313
OL,3,CPolice looking into Polanski post
OL,4,Cafter complaints by Reform UK
OL,6,F"After attending a public event, Zack
OL,7,Faccepted a request to collaborate on a
OL,8,Fpost with several images," the
OL,9,Fspokesperson said.
OL,11,F"Once this image was brought to his
OL,12,Fattention he immediately unshared the
OL,13,Fpost. He unequivocally does not
OL,14,Fsupport this type of dangerous
OL,15,Fmessage."
OL,17,FFarage is currently campaigning to be
OL,18,Fre-elected in Clapton, where he
OL,19,Fstepped down as an MP in early July
OL,20,Ffollowing scrutiny over his personal
OL,21,Ffinances.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
